      "sections": [
        {
          "h": "Why Notion stands out",
          "html": "<p>Notion's strength lies in its flexibility as a connected knowledge base. With databases that can link to each other, powerful templates for everything from meeting notes to product roadmaps, and AI that works inside every block of text, it excels at helping teams organize information and collaborate on documentation. The gentle learning curve means everyone can contribute quickly.</p>"
        },
        {
          "h": "Why Coda stands out",
          "html": "<p>Coda shines when you want to build something that feels like a lightweight internal tool without actually building software. Its document-as-app approach lets you create pages with tables that interact, buttons that trigger workflows, and automations that run in the background. For teams tired of context switching between multiple tools, Coda offers a way to bring everything into one canvas.</p>"
        },
        {
          "h": "AI comparison",
          "html": "<p>Both tools have embraced AI in 2026, but with different approaches. Notion's AI works as a writing assistant embedded throughout the interface - highlight text, press space, and get help rewriting or summarizing. Coda's AI acts more like a co-builder: describe what you want to build in plain language, and it helps generate the tables, buttons, and automations needed. If your primary need is better writing and knowledge work, Notion's AI integration is smoother. If you want to build workflows and reduce tool sprawl, Coda's AI-powered app building is compelling.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "verdict": "<p><b>Our verdict:</b> Choose Notion if your team needs a flexible knowledge base where everyone can contribute to documents, databases and wikis with minimal training. Choose Coda if you want to build app-like workflows that replace multiple point solutions, especially if offline access and deep automation are important.</p><p>For hosting your workspace files, consider <a href=\"https://ishosting.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ishosting</a> for reliable VPS solutions in 40+ countries.</p>",
